<title>JAPAN: Toyo Wharf - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Wharf - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.22		vs	   12.13</p>
<p> Operating	  958    million    vs	  893    million</p>
<p> Current	    885    million    vs	  774    million</p>
<p> Net		  495    million    vs	  287    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.88 yen	  vs	    3.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     84 million	  vs	  84 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Wharf &amp; Warehouse Co Ltd is a wharf warehousing company.</p>
